Views_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── isYoVault
│  ├── given vault registered → returns true
│  ├── given vault never registered → returns false
│  ├── given vault registered then removed → returns false
│  └── any caller can read (no auth)
└── listYoVaults
   ├── given empty registry → returns empty array
   ├── given multiple vaults → returns all of them
   ├── after remove of one → returns remaining
   └── stays consistent with isYoVault
